FitBuddy – AI Fitness Plan Generator using Gemini Models

Phase 3 – Project Design

1. System Architecture

The FitBuddy system consists of three main parts:

User → FitBuddy Application → Gemini Model → Fitness Plan

2. System Flow

User
  ↓
Enter Fitness Details
  ↓
FitBuddy Application
  ↓
Send Prompt to Gemini
  ↓
Gemini Processes Input
  ↓
Generate Fitness Plan
  ↓
Display Plan to User

3. Main Modules

1. User Input Module
Collects the user's fitness details and goals.

2. AI Processing Module
Sends the user information to the Gemini model and processes the response.

3. Fitness Plan Module
Generates a personalized workout plan.

4. Output Module
Displays the generated fitness plan to the user.

4. Design Goal

The application is designed to be simple, user-friendly, and easy to use, while using Gemini AI to generate personalized fitness plans.